Package: MeasureQual
Title: Claim-Scoped Qualification of Computational Measurements
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R: person("Zichen", "Sheng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "225113177+ZichenSheng@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Tools for claim-scoped qualification of computational measurements,
    signatures and related quantitative constructs under explicit context,
    reference and detectability assumptions. Checks declared scientific units,
    callback dependencies, constructibility and inferential support, evaluates
    declared alternatives, and produces canonical evidence records with
    constrained interpretation. Scientific assumptions, thresholds and
    decision rules are supplied by the analyst.
